      "text": "tips on using the remote control:\nSome conditions, such as room lighting, furniture that blocks the signal path, or direct sunlight, can affect remote operation.\nIf the remote does not work as it should:\nPoint the remote more directly at the right speaker, • which receives the remote control signals.\nDim the room lights or move the speakers away from • direct sunlight.\nMove closer to the system when you use the remote. •\nIf the problem persists, replace the remote control • battery.",
